:i64))) (loopx (ref (vec :str))) (looph (ref (vec :str))) (esc (ref (vec :str))) (cl (ref (vec :str))) (berr (ref (vec lower-error))) (insn (ref (vec :str))) (ivd (ref (vec :i64))) (ivn (ref (vec :str))) (ivt (ref (vec :i64))) (ivb (ref (vec :i64))) (ivc (ref (vec :i64))) (curn (ref (vec :str))) (curt (ref (vec :i64))) (node :i64))
  (let arm :i64 (lo-child nod ntx node 2))
  (if (< arm 0)
    (ret -1)
    (lo-nothing))
  (let last :i64 (lo-child nod ntx arm (- (lo-count nod ntx arm) 1)))
  (let p :i64 (lo-child nod ntx arm 0))
  (let pn :i64 (lo-child nod ntx p 1))
  (letmut mut-body :str "")
  (if (lo-atom? nod last)
    (set mut-body (lo-atom nod ntx last))
    (lo-nothing))
  (let direct :bool (and (>= pn 0)
                      (str-eq mut-body (lo-atom nod ntx pn))))
  (if (not direct)
    (ret (lo-node-type mtriple mqual snames sbase scount sftys enames ewords gnames gdata dnames dsig dcnt dret sigtys fnames fsyms fint fret fbase fcnt fparam fpc pnames ptys blabels bbase bcnt bterm bty bhas bv1 bv2 bv3 ops dests sa sb sc sd t1 t2 t3 n1 sst scn tst tcn svals tvals tags tnames elem extra pbase powner tpnames tptypes pchild pvname nod ntx tnk tnv tnl fnk fnv fnl enk env enl vnk vnv vni vnp bindn bindt binds binda plan planty st loopx looph esc cl berr insn ivd ivn ivt ivb ivc curn curt last -2))
    (lo-nothing))
  (let stype :i64 (lo-type-item mtriple mqual snames sbase scount sftys enames ewords gnames gdata dnames dsig dcnt dret sigtys fnames fsyms fint fret fbase fcnt fparam fpc pnames ptys blabels bbase bcnt bterm bty bhas bv1 bv2 bv3 ops dests sa sb sc sd t1 t2 t3 n1 sst scn tst tcn svals tvals tags tnames elem extra pbase powner tpnames tptypes pchild pvname nod ntx tnk tnv tnl fnk fnv fnl enk env enl vnk vnv vni vnp bindn bindt binds binda plan planty st loopx looph esc cl berr insn ivd ivn ivt ivb ivc curn curt (lo-child nod ntx node 1)))
  (letmut found :bool false)
  (letmut answer :i64 -1)
  (if (= (vec-get tags stype)
        (type-tag-res))
    (if (str-eq (lo-head nod ntx p) "ok")
      (set answer (vec-get elem stype))
      (set answer (vec-get extra stype)))
    (lo-nothing))
  (if (= (vec-get tags stype)
        (type-tag-res))
    (set found true)
    (lo-nothing))
  (if (= (vec-get tags stype)
        (type-tag-opt))
    (set answer (vec-get elem stype))
    (lo-nothing))
  (if (= (vec-get tags stype)
        (type-tag-opt))
    (set found true)
    (lo-nothing))
  (let v :i64 (lo-variant-find vnk vnv (lo-head nod ntx p) stype))
  (if (and (= (vec-get tags stype)
             (type-tag-enum))
        (>= v 0))
    (set answer (vec-get vnp v))
    (lo-nothing))
  (if (and (= (vec-get tags stype)
             (type-tag-enum))
        (>= v 0))
    (set found true)
    (lo-nothing))
  (if found
    (ret answer)
